    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.78,
      498.14,
      286.29,
      553.55
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land / servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      6.960000038146973,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      62.78,
      553.07,
      271.96,
      564.09
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.78,
      564.08,
      286.26,
      672.71
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land is called Nikatenna waththa about 0.0202 hectares in extent is depicted as Lot 01, in preliminary plan Number P.P.K 3742 and dated 17/12/2019 made by the Senior Survey Superintendent and situated in the Village of Walimanna, in the Grama Niladari Division of No. 43 B, Gataberikantha, in the Minor Division of Galbadakorale (West), in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Aranayaka, in the District of Kegalle, in Sabaragamuwa Province. Boundaries are as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.78,
      675.13,
      286.25,
      717.47
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 - Name of the land: Nikathanna waththa; Other Details: Land has been acquired under Section 38 (A) under provision of Sub section. Preliminary claimant is not identified and for the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      420.56,
      539.85,
      442.02
    ],
    "text": "completion of land acquisition activities; Extent: 0.0202 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.807945251464844,
      9.816690444946289,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      441.84,
      539.86,
      501.45
    ],
    "text": "North: Road (Pradeshiya Shaba) and Nikatenna waththa; East: Nikathanna waththa and Buwalikada waththa; South: Road and Buwalikada waththa and Nikathanna waththa; West: Nikathenna waththa and Road.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      501.29,
      539.86,
      569.25
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land / lands on which a servitude or any other relevance are to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat Aranayaka, 11th day of September 2024 at 10.00 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      6.480000019073486,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      569.12,
      539.9,
      704.15
    ],
    "text": "Further they should notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 04th day of September 2024 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and details of the computation such amount. Shamali Piyathissa, Divisional Secretary, Aranayake. At Divisional Secretariat, Aranayake. 02nd of August 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      6.960000038146973,
      9.960000038146973,
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
